      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sacs",
          "text": "After a truck accident in Boulder, you will need to determine liability before you file an insurance claim. This is because Colorado is a fault-based car insurance state, where the driver or party at fault for the collision will be liable, or financially responsible. After a truck accident, and only if it is safe, write down or take photos of the truck driver’s personal information, company information, and insurance information for future reference. This can help you establish liability later.",
          "marks": []
        }
