        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sadf",
          "text": "Compensation in a truck accident depends upon the kind of injuries the victim received and the extent of those injuries. To learn more about compensation in a truck accident claim or filing a truck accident lawsuit, contact our firm today.",
