    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "badk",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sadj",
          "text": "Truck accident lawsuits are not the same as typical car accident lawsuits. As an injured truck accident victim, you may wish to give your case to an attorney for the best possible results. An attorney will understand how to navigate all of the unique issues related to a commercial truck accident, including:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "badm",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sadl",
          "text": "Catastrophic injuries. Truck injury claims are often worth more money than standard passenger vehicle accidents due to the seriousness of the injuries involved. It is important not to settle your claim until you confirm the fairness of the offer.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bado",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sadn",
          "text": "Federal trucking laws. A truck accident lawsuit involves laws that only apply to motor carriers, such as hours-of-service restrictions for truck drivers. An attorney will understand these laws and how they impact your case.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "badq",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sadp",
          "text": "The size of the adversary. A trucking company presents a strong and formidable defendant in a personal injury claim, with a powerful insurance company and aggressive lawyers. Level the playing field by hiring an attorney of your own.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bads",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sadr",
          "text": "A Boulder truck accident lawyer from Dormer Harpring can help you navigate all of the unique aspects of your truck accident case. We understand how these cases work and will use years of experience to help you move forward.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "badu",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sadt",
          "text": "Truck Accident Cases Have Time-Sensitive Evidence",
