        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "badw",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sadv",
          "text": "Another key reason to hire a truck accident lawyer is for assistance in preserving and collecting evidence. The trucking company will send a rapid response team with investigators and crash analysts to the scene of the collision right away – even before the police arrive. Although the rapid response team is supposed to be impartial, it works for the trucking company. It may attempt to collect evidence and even alter the scene before you have a chance to investigate.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
