      "_key": "bady",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sadx",
          "text": "Contacting a truck accident lawyer right away can enable you to protect time-sensitive evidence from the start, including:",
