      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sae9",
          "text": "Eyewitness statements",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baec",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saeb",
          "text": "Employment and maintenance records from the truck company",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baee",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saed",
          "text": "Cell phone records",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baeg",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saef",
          "text": "Drug and alcohol test results",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baei",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saeh",
          "text": "If you wait too long to speak to an attorney, some of this evidence may no longer be viable or available. Waiting too long to obtain signed witness statements, for example, could weaken their credibility, as memories of the accident will fade over time. An attorney can make phone calls, file letters of spoilation and take other steps to ensure the protection of key evidence.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baek",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saej",
          "text": "Should You Speak to an Insurance Company?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baem",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sael",
          "text": "It is wise to speak to a truck accident attorney before you talk to an insurance company about your accident. You can trust the advice and information you receive from a personal injury lawyer. A lawyer can help you communicate with an insurance company in a way that will not hurt your case.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baeo",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saen",
          "text": "For example, your lawyer may recommend not giving the insurance company a recorded statement about the truck accident. A recorded statement is a common tactic used to take advantage of claimants. You should also avoid signing anything given to you by the insurance company without first sending it to an attorney.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baeq",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saep",
          "text": "Finally, you shouldn’t say yes to the first settlement offered, as it may not adequately reimburse you for your injuries and losses. A truck accident lawyer in Boulder can take over communications with an insurance claims adjuster on your behalf to negotiate for fair and full financial compensation.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baes",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saer",
          "text": "Let a Boulder Truck Accident Attorney Assist You with Your Claim",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
